{"id": "1-2952", "turn": 0, "ok": true, "state_ok": true, "reply_ok": true, "changes": {}, "calls": 2, "seconds": 23.207, "text": "Go for it. Solar's making 8109 watts and the battery's charging, plenty of room."}
{"id": "1-397", "turn": 0, "ok": true, "state_ok": true, "reply_ok": true, "changes": {}, "calls": 2, "seconds": 17.673, "text": "No, not at this rate. 100 percent is roughly 7.7 hours at 1823 watts, and the sun's not up until 06:28. There's nothing big I can switch off."}
